    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cute Growth-Based Othello</h2>&quot;Dog vs Cat Othello&quot; is an adorable Othello game where you battle with your favorite dog or cat characters.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Element: Evolve Your Own Pieces</h2>Adding a new twist to the traditional Othello rules, characters evolve and earn points with each flipped stone, making old strategies obsolete! Creating high-scoring characters can lead to dramatic turnarounds!<br><br>Strategically flip your opponent's stones and dominate the board with your evolved characters.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Local Two-Player Mode Available</h2>Play not only solo but also locally with friends.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play and Unlock Various Characters</h2>Defeat numerous CPUs to unlock new characters and use a variety of characters.<br><br><br><strong>Recommended For:</strong><br>Those who love Othello or Reversi but find it becoming repetitive.<br>Those who want to play with designs that elevate the excitement beyond just black and white stones.<br>Those who adore dogs and cats.<br>Those looking for a new twist on board games.<br><br><strong>Future Plans:</strong><br>\u30fbOnline multiplayer<br>\u30fbNew characters<br>\u30fbNew game features",
